    "title": "Two women jailed for intox, interference - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeff Grant ,\n12 hours ago SHELDON—Two Sheldon women face charges following the investigation of a possible vehicular accident about 8:35 p.m. Sunday, Feb. 15, in Sheldon. An officer found 34-year-old Irma Chavez Lopez standing outside the driver’s side door of a 2009 Honda Civic and 31-year-old Reina Angelina Chavez Lopez as a passenger in the vehicle on the 100 block of 17th Avenue in Sheldon, according to the Sheldon Police Department. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
